y move 16.","Watch your pawn: it is behind 26% of your lost leads, 1.2\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the h-pawn (39%), landing on h5, g5, h6.","Aim at their knight: it is behind 24% of their lost leads, 1.3\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the king's knight (52%). The reply wins it outright 28% of the time. Take it with a bishop.","Material changes hands for you on d5 and e5: build pressure there.","They win material on e5 and f6: keep those squares defended.","Look for the pin: it appears 2.3\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Bishop's Opening"}